      "rationale_chunks_concat_exact": [
        "All ten IDs were compared across all three seeds after reading every supplied projected field. Products, actual process distinctions, empirical versus commercial basis, exact model strings/roles, aliases for b001, measurement-column types and units are preserved. b001/b002/b007/b008 retain friction, roughness and film depth; b003/b009 retain friction and roughness only; b004/b010 retain friction only; b005 retains component inspection dimensions, edition identity and month; b006 retains commercial price and carton dimensions, never performance measurements. Text variation is meaningful: titles, clause order, paragraphing, length, presence of ",
        "column lists in the main description, optional spatial text, publishers, sites and two-versus-three distribution arrangements vary, not merely a category prefix. Each distribution's entire synopsis was checked: distribution 0 consistently claims CSV/comma-separated tables, distribution 1 PDF/document tables, and optional distribution 2's CSV or PDF wording matches its format and repeats that record's documented columns/values. Verification is of metadata association, not downloaded file bytes. Strict all-facts preservation is unresolved: numeric examples and study context change, not just wording. For b001, distributions.0.description roughne",
        "ss/friction/film examples are 1.68/0.56/1.71 in 39031, 1.65/0.53/1.28 in 39032 and 1.41/0.57/0.68 in 39033. Its description site changes Ivy Brook Central to Elm Crossing Upper to Granite Bend Lower, with different publishers. No packet evidence states these altered values/context are interchangeable wording-only variations. Thus concept/column preservation is supported, but unchanged measured facts cannot be certified. The packet supplies intent definitions/IDs, not literal query/paraphrase texts; paraphrase equivalence and complete-corpus coverage are outside this packet review. No actual record supports either frozen no-answer conjunction.",
        " No searchable instruction, grade code or answer-key claim was observed."
      ],
      "reviewer_id": "auditor-packet-11"
    },
    "39032": {
      "passed": false,
      "rationale_chunks_concat_exact": [
        "All ten seed-39032 records and all their projected title, description, distribution, keyword, publisher and present spatial fields were reviewed against both other versions. Measurement types, units, model strings/roles, component exclusions, b001 aliases and the commercial-ledger distinction are preserved; descriptions and titles meaningfully change structure, length, ordering and whether columns appear in the description or only distributions. Optional spatial fields and distribution counts/titles also vary. CSV/PDF format labels match their full synopses and associated columns in every distribution; no measured variable is added from an om",
        "ission or negation. This is metadata-level verification, not inspection of underlying files. A strict facts-preserved result remains unresolved because explicit numerical examples and context differ across seeds: b005 distributions.0.description physical specification examples are 63.03 mm in 39031, 101.28 mm in 39032, and 70.66 mm in 39033, although the component remains RUN-X120-SOLE and reporting month 2024-06. b006 advertised retail cost changes 244.89 to 84.76 to 206.41 AUD/unit, while carton length changes 132 to 281 to 157 mm; these are not paraphrases of identical numeric facts. Seed-39032 b006 explicitly calls the deposit an observed",
        " commercial ledger, not experimental performance, so its testing association was not counted as positively measured performance. Stable concept-level coverage does not certify numeric/context preservation. Literal query texts and underlying distribution bytes were not supplied; no wider corpus, actual rankings or omitted duplicated queryContext copies were inspected."
      ],
      "reviewer_id": "auditor-packet-11"
    },
    "39033": {
      "passed": false,
      "rationale_chunks_concat_exact": [
        "All ten seed-39033 records were exhaustively reviewed and compared with 39031/39032. Actual product/process/basis distinctions, exact digit/letter/prefix/suffix identities, b001 aliases and the same per-ID measurement-column sets and units survive. The separately supplied sole assembly stays component-only; RUN-X1200 remains commercial price/carton data and is not treated as a wet-performance experiment. Meaningful variation includes title wording, sentence ordering, paragraphs, substantial description-length changes, columns in description versus synopses, optional spatial text and publisher/site context. Every supplied distribution synopsis",
        " repeats the correct per-record columns/values, with comma-separated wording for CSV and document-table wording for PDF, including all optional third distributions. This verifies metadata association only. Strict fact-value preservation is unresolved: b003 distributions.0.description roughness/friction examples change from 0.35/0.5 in 39031 to 1.28/0.51 in 39032 and 1.44/0.7 in 39033; b009 friction changes 0.76 to 0.54 to 0.83; b010 friction changes 0.61 to 0.37 to 0.43. The numerical and site/publisher changes are substantive rather than textual synonyms, although all column types remain supported. No evidence in this packet establishes perm",
        "ission to regard those changed explicit facts as preserved. Literal query/paraphrase text, underlying file bytes and corpus-wide positive/absence coverage cannot be certified from the permitted materials. No record supports a frozen no-answer conjunction; no searchable grade/intent leakage or instruction was observed."
